":"you've cut yourself! — it's nothing","chinese":"你割伤自己了！──没事儿"},{"english":"it's nothing more than a cold","chinese":"只不过是感冒而已"}]},{"id":"nothing:o:f716d29d3b8d","label":"pron.","definitionZh":"用以强调对比","glossesEn":["for emphasis"],"examples":[{"english":"there's nothing more ridiculous than …","chinese":"没有什么比…更荒谬可笑"},{"english":"there's nothing like sth/doing sth","chinese":"没什么比得了某事物/做某事"},{"english":"there's nothing like seeing old friends","chinese":"没什么比得上和老朋友见面"}]},{"id":"nothing:o:19b0bc328fed","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"一点也不","examples":[{"english":"to care nothing for sb/sth","chinese":"根本不关心某人/某事"},{"english":"nothing like sb/sth","chinese":"一点也不像某人/某物；根本不"},{"english":"the city is nothing like what it was","chinese":"这座城市已经面目全非"}]},{"id":"nothing:o:26d572402b3d","label":"n.","definitionZh":"虚无","glossesEn":["nothingness"],"examples":[{"english":"an explanation of how the universe came out of nothing","chinese":"关于宇宙如何产生于虚无的一种解释"}]},{"id":"nothing:o:12abbc3d18b9","label":"n.","definitionZh":"琐事","glossesEn":["trivial matter"],"examples":[{"english":"it's a mere nothing","chinese":"这简直微不足道"}]},{"id":"nothing:o:1ab683d7c601","label":"n.","definitionZh":"小人物","glossesEn":["unimportant person"],"examples":[{"english":"she's a nothing and a nobody","chinese":"她只是个无名小卒"}]},{"id":"nothing:o:ce1b42f627f9","label":"n.","definitionZh":"零","glossesEn":["zero"],"examples":[{"english":"we lost four nothing","chinese":"我们0比4输了"}]},{"id":"nothing:o:f1250c17acb5","label":"adv. phr.","definitionZh":"不花钱","glossesEn":["without payment"],"examples":[{"english":"he gave it to me for nothing","chinese":"他把它白送给了我"},{"english":"to get something for nothing","chinese":"不劳而获"},{"english":"it's money for nothing","chinese":"这钱来得容易"}]},{"id":"nothing:o:90d82b31cc89","label":"adv. phr.","definitionZh":"毫不费力","glossesEn":["without effort"]},{"id":"nothing:o:5e721654e109","label":"adv. phr.","definitionZh":"徒劳","glossesEn":["to no purpose"],"examples":[{"english":"all that troubl